---

Third-party code and weights:

* jit/model.py vendors modules from the JiT release
  (https://github.com/LTH14/JiT, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Tianhong Li).
* The MiniT2I port imports the released model code from https://github.com/Hope7Happiness/minit2i-torch
  (MIT License) at run time; it is not vendored.
* The pMF port imports the released model code from https://github.com/Lyy-iiis/pMF (branch torch, MIT License)
  at run time; it is not vendored. pmf/loss_pmf_apt.py ports that repository's training objective to PyTorch.
* The PixelDiT port imports the released model code from https://github.com/NVlabs/PixelDiT at run
  time; it is not vendored. The PixelDiT code and the released PixelDiT weights are distributed by
  NVIDIA under the NVIDIA License (NSCLv1), which permits non-commercial use only. The BudgetPix
  PixelDiT checkpoint is a derivative of those weights and is released under the same terms.
